  A submodule at third_party/dolphin, unmodified, which a normal checkout
  skips (update = none). The buildDolphin task in app/build.gradle.kts fetches
  it with its externals (not Externals/Qt, Externals/FFmpeg-bin or
  Externals/wil, which are for Windows), builds it for arm64-v8a with the
  NDK's CMake toolchain as libretro's buildbot does (-DLIBRETRO=ON
