  libdolphin_libretro_android.so; and zips GameSettings, GC, Shaders,
  Resources, ApprovedInis.json and codehandler.bin from its Data/Sys,
  unmodified, as assets/cores/dolphin.zip. Neither is committed; the source
  they are built from is the submodule at that commit.

